5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Since it's the first day, I think we should all introduce ourselves and try to get a feel for who we are dealing with. Does anyone have any initial thoughts?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm Rin! I'm super excited to play this game! I'll find the werewolf in no time, just you wait and see!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm Mizuki. I'll be observing everyone's behavior and logic carefully. Let's try to keep a cool head so we can identify the werewolf efficiently.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone, I'm Midori. It's a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can all get along and work together to find the werewolf peacefully.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm Takumi. I'm not going to let the werewolf win, so don't expect me to just sit back. Let's get this over with.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we all have a strong determination to win. Since we have no information yet, perhaps we should discuss what patterns or behaviors we should look for during the first few days.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,Maybe we can see who is acting too quiet or who is trying to act too nice! That's how I'd do it if I were the werewolf!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"That's an interesting point, Rin, but we should be careful not to rely solely on intuition. We need to look for contradictions in statements as the game progresses.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Mizuki. While intuition is helpful, we should be careful not to jump to conclusions too quickly. Let's try to be patient and supportive of one another.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Patience is fine, but if we're too slow, the werewolf just gets more chances to kill us. We need to be decisive when we find a lead.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand your urgency, Takumi. However, a hasty mistake could cost us a valuable ally. Perhaps we can focus on how people react to the first night's results tomorrow.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"That's a great idea, Jonathan! I'll be watching everyone's faces tomorrow to see who looks suspicious when we find out what happened!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be paying close attention to the timing and nature of the claims made tomorrow. If someone claims to be the Seer, we'll need to verify if their information is consistent.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I think that's a very logical approach, Mizuki. I'll do my best to be honest and helpful so we can all feel safe and find the truth together.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'll be watching too. If anyone starts acting weird or trying to deflect suspicion onto others, I'm calling them out immediately.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we have a plan for tomorrow. Let's all try to get some rest and stay alert. I look forward to seeing how the first night unfolds.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to dream about catching that werewolf! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Goodnight. I'll be analyzing everything we've discussed today to see if any patterns emerge. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. I hope we all have a peaceful night and wake up to a day where we can make some real progress. See you tomorrow.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Yeah, goodnight. Just make sure you're ready to actually do something tomorrow. See ya.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
