31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I have some critical information to share. I am the Seer, and I divined Takumi last night. He is the werewolf.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"What?! No way! Takumi is the werewolf? I can't believe it! Is it really true, Jonathan?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"This is a very bold claim to make so early, Jonathan. While it's efficient if true, we must consider the possibility that the werewolf is claiming to be the Seer to frame Takumi. Takumi, what is your response?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock. I want to believe Jonathan, but Mizuki is right that we should hear Takumi's side of the story first. Takumi, what do you have to say?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! You're lying! I'm not the werewolf! Jonathan is just trying to get me kicked out right away so he can hide his own identity. This is a total setup!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand it's a shock, but I have no reason to lie. As the Seer, my goal is to protect the village, and the most direct way to do that is to identify the werewolf immediately.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to believe you, Jonathan, but Takumi sounds really mad! If Takumi is the werewolf, why would he be so loud about it? Or maybe that's just how werewolves act? I'm so confused!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Emotional reactions aren't reliable evidence, Rin. Takumi's anger could be genuine frustration or a calculated defense. Jonathan, if you are the Seer, why did you choose Takumi specifically for your first divination?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That's a very important question, Mizuki. Jonathan, could you explain your reasoning for choosing Takumi? It would help us feel more confident in your information.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Don't listen to him! He's just making things up to get rid of me! He probably just picked me because I'm the youngest and thought I'd be an easy target to frame!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I chose Takumi because his aggressive demeanor during Day 0 felt like a potential cover for the werewolf's nature. I wanted to be certain early on to save as many lives as possible.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"That makes sense! Takumi was being really pushy yesterday. But if we're wrong, we lose a friend! I don't want to make a mistake!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we execute Takumi and he is innocent, we lose a villager and the werewolf remains. However, if Jonathan is the Seer, keeping Takumi alive is a fatal mistake. We must weigh the risk of a fake Seer against the risk of a real werewolf.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I feel for Takumi, but Jonathan's explanation is quite reasonable. If we trust him, we could end this nightmare right now. Do you think there's any other way to verify this, Mizuki?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"There is no other way! You're all just going to believe some guy who says he has magic powers? This is ridiculous! I'm a villager, and Jonathan is the one lying to your faces!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am not claiming magic, but the role of the Seer. If you execute me instead, the werewolf will simply kill another of us tonight. I urge you to trust my divination and vote for Takumi.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'll trust Jonathan! He's been so calm and kind, and his reason for picking Takumi makes sense. I'm sorry, Takumi, but I'm voting for you!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"While I still have reservations about the speed of this revelation, the logic holds. If Jonathan is lying, he risks being executed tomorrow if the werewolf is still among us. I will vote for Takumi.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm very sorry, Takumi, but I think it's safest to trust Jonathan's information. I'll vote for Takumi as well, hoping for the good of the village.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,You're all making a huge mistake! You're just handing the win to the werewolf on a silver platter! I can't believe you're all this gullible! I'm a villager!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
